    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Four curved blades, motor housing with cooling fins, downrod, ceiling canopy and a frosted light diffuser are distinct parts. The top and bottom views confirm correct blade pitch and a closed motor underside. Brushed metal and matte black read as separate materials. 16.4k tris.",
